<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Labour Board say Feb unemployment 8.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Swedish Labour Board say Feb unemployment 8.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Labour Board (AMS) on Thursday said unemployment in February fell to 8.4 percent from 9.0 percent in January.</p>
<p>Sweden's central statistics bureau, Statistics Sweden, will release its February unemployment data on Friday, March 7 at 1200 GMT. It said January unemployment was 8.8 percent.</p>
<p>-- Belinda Goldsmith, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
